<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Labour Board says Jan unemployment 9.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish Labour Board says Jan unemployment 9.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Labour Board said on Thursday that unemployment in January rose to 9.0 percent or 383,000 people which was 3,000 higher than in December last year.  </p>
<p>The board said this was 33,000 more people unemployed than in January 1996 when the level of unemployment was 8.2 percent.</p>
<p>Sweden's official statistics bureau Statistics Sweden is due to release its January unemployment data on February 7 at 1200 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
